<p>Decimal 36867. Raw name for this VIC chip register. Also known as <strong>SCREEN_TEXT_HEIGHT</strong>, where the full description lives.</p>
<p>Number of rows, part of the raster counter, and character size.</p>
<ul>
<li>Bit 7 - bit 0 of the raster beam location</li>
<li>Bits 6-1 - number of character rows, default is 23</li>
<li>Bit 0 - character size, 0 = 8x8, 1 = 8x16</li>
</ul>
